  m_Name: TheHangedManCardEnding
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Card
  name: The Hanged Man
  text: " The card swings silently in your hand, heavy with doom and the weight of
    choices unmade.  $ Its image twists time and fate, showing sacrifice, suffering,
    and consequences that cannot be avoided.  $The Hand of the King has discovered
    the truth. The secret loves, the schemes, the rebellion\u2014all laid bare. $In
    the kingdom\u2019s shadow, there is no mercy: the Head of the Royal Guard and
    the Jester are hanged. The princess, crushed by despair, takes her own life.  "
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1e97bcc33d5452acd9a845ed6a0b8654, type: 3}
